"P4293719284" "Catch it unawares, and you may find this giant mushroom blissfully content, drinking in the atmosphere of Hamidon's strange Eden. If it sees you, though, watch out! Stropharia seems intent on exacting revenge for all its cousins that met their fate in a buttery saucepan."
// DisplayNames :
"P2003366192" "Stropharia"

