// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Warworks_BCU_A 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2901112643" "The most basic unit in the Warworks arsenal. These models are equipped with a heavy assault PGMP Rifle and both nano-repair technology and force fields."
// GroupDescription :
"P25399983" "The Infested"
// DisplayNames :
"P62530798" "Infested BCU"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Warworks_BCU_B 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Warworks_ACU_A 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P388952242" "The most advanced of the Warworks shock troopers. These towering androids carry a heavy PGMP Rifle that is capable of delivering a deadly neurotoxin payload."
// DisplayNames :
"P33331895" "Infested ACU"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Warworks_ACU_B 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Assault_Trooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1943650702" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Assault Troopers are equipped with an upgraded Plasma Glove and Power Armor with jump boosters, making them resistant to all types of damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P1562000574" "Infested Assault Trooper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Ranger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2302002835" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Rangers are equipped with an upgraded Plasma Glove and Power Armor, making them resistant to all types of damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P4068854919" "Infested Ranger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Heavy_Trooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4225690044" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Heavy Troopers wear heavy Power Armor with jump boosters as well as shoulder mounted rocket launchers that are capable of delivering a powerful nerve gas that can cripple enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P1938036043" "Infested Heavy Trooper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Shock_Trooper 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3584830775" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force Troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Shock Troopers are terrifying foes to engage. Their weaponry is far more advanced than the PPD Shock Glove, and they are decked out in nearly impenetrable power armor."
// DisplayNames :
"P2938242689" "Infested Shock Trooper"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Elite_Ranger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3001854750" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. The IDF Elite Rangers are terrifying foes to engage. Their weaponry is far more advanced than the PPD Shock Glove, and they are decked out in nearly impenetrable power armor."
// DisplayNames :
"P1466863855" "Infested Elite Ranger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Seer_Scryer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P818779251" "Scyers are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They make up the rank and file combatants among the elite. They specialize in tearing their foes minds apart with their mental assault while peering into the mind of their foes to find their weakness."
// DisplayNames :
"P1332619807" "Infested Scryer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Seer_Seeker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1707654086" "Seekers are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They make up the rank and file combatants among the elite. Seekers have the ability to mend others wounds with their minds as well as augment their allies with mental wards."
// DisplayNames :
"P306366343" "Infested Seeker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Seer_Diviner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1493841138" "Diviners are among the elite of Mother Mayhem's Seers. They are mid-rank combatants among the elite. They specialize in crushing their foes in close range combat."
// DisplayNames :
"P1323534156" "Infested Diviner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Seer_Augur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1791998782" "Augurs are the elite amongst the Seers and are masters of mind control. They are capable of crippling their enemies with powerful mental assaults then moving in for the kill."
// DisplayNames :
"P3832240646" "Infested Augur"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_PPD_TEST_Ranger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3202429529" "The final physical challenge that a member of the PPD goes through in order to be admitted into the Tactical Engagement Strike Team is speculated about in hushed whispers all over Praetoria. Those who succeed won't speak of it and those who fail don't survive the experience."
// DisplayNames :
"P1024861096" "Infested T.E.S.T. Ranger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_PPD_TEST_Leader 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3991243719" "Tactical Engagement Strike Team Leaders are always selected from within the ranks. They are trained to take down lawbreakers hard and fast with no concern for secondary objectives like avoiding collateral damage."
// DisplayNames :
"P2876197004" "Infested T.E.S.T. Leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_PPD_TEST_Provost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3647034139" "Anything that pulls a PPD Provost out of their Monitor Sphere information nexus has to be considered a severe threat. In order to insure their safety, Provosts don the state of the art in PPD protective gear to restore order in the most extreme cases of lawbreaking."
// DisplayNames :
"P2395909008" "Infested T.E.S.T. Provost"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_Malignant_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3059571794" "The Malignant Seedling is a specialized Seedling which is capable of surviving for a long period of time in an enormous range of conditions. They are often dispatched into areas where the Seed of Hamidon cannot be sent, where they wreak havoc on the environment before beginning the process of converting it to an infested wasteland."
// DisplayNames :
"P2309028754" "Malignant Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthInfested_AvatarOfHamidon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :

