// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Seed_Of_Hamidon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P687336853" "The Seed of Hamidon can be seen from miles away, spreading the Hamidon infestation throughout the Sunken City.  The Seed surrounds itself with a thick cloud of spores and uses its Seedlings to manipulate their properties, giving it massive powers of control over everything in its vicinity."
// DisplayNames :
"P1188567604" "The Seed of Hamidon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Bulwark_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3050979723" "Bulwark Seedlings are the Seed's primary source of defense against Cole's forces and wayward superpowered beings.  Every Bulwark Seedling alive increases the Seed of Hamidon's defenses against all types of attack."
// DisplayNames :
"P2276260999" "Bulwark Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Bulwark_Seedling_AutoFlight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Hematic_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3176716870" "Hematic Seedlings are the Seed's cardiovascular entities.  Every Hematic Seedling alive allows the Seed to drain the vitality from the bodies of anyone who would oppose it, lowering their Resistance and Defense as well as weakening the effects of all healing on them."
// DisplayNames :
"P3022772226" "Hematic Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Hematic_Seedling_AutoFlight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Maturing_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4036122356" "Maturing Seedlings are the Seed's antibodies.  Every Maturing Seedling alive provides the Seed with a fairly substantial amount of healing over time."
// DisplayNames :
"P119219373" "Maturing Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Maturing_Seedling_AutoFlight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Respiring_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2117131091" "Respiring Seedlings allow the Seed of Hamidon to thicken the cloud of spores surrounding its body.  For each Respiring Seedling alive, it becomes more difficult to hit the Seed and the range at which it can be attacked is lowered."
// DisplayNames :
"P1461383965" "Respiring Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Respiring_Seedling_AutoFlight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Contaminating_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P797445396" "Contaminating Seedlings infect the brains of nearby enemies with rapidly evolving strains of the Tellurian Plague, seriously impairing the victims' mental faculties.  For each Contaminating Seedling it spawns, the Seed of Hamidon lowers the recharge and endurance of anyone within its spore cloud."
// DisplayNames :
"P3023193897" "Contaminating Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Contaminating_Seedling_AutoFlight 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Malignant_Infection_Jump 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// GroupDescription :
"P306689739" "Malignant_Infection"
// DisplayNames :
"P1311620043" "Contagion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Decomposition 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3195993993" "Decomposing Field"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Swarm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1300820828" "These nettlesome swarms are crawling over the Seed of Hamidon and infest the Seedlings when they are produced. These swarms are potentially very dangerous, as they will become extremely furious if pressed and can erupt in a cloud of noxious chemicals."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Fury 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4242688074" "Fury of the Swarm"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Tellurian_Seedling 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P639035864" "Tellurian Seedlings function as the Seed's antibodies, used against Cole's forces and superpowered beings who dare venture near the massive beast.  Every Tellurian Seedling spreads a particularly virulent strand of the Plague, capable of melting the victim's mind in mere seconds."
// DisplayNames :
"P328618714" "Tellurian Seedling"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Seed_Of_Hamidon_Mission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Tellurian_Seedling_Mission_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Tellurian_Seedling_Mission_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - DevouringEarthSeed_Tellurian_Seedling_Mission_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

