// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Raider 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2581384859" "Raiders are toughened survivalists who embody the phrase "Kill or be killed".  These scavengers often take to robbing, killing, and enslaving the citizens of First Ward in order to sustain themselves."
// DisplayNames :
"P4222026277" "Raider"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Raider_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Wastelander 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4085000428" "Wastelanders are veteran First Ward survivors.  They are extremely tough after years of exposure to the elements and dangers of the area.  They tend to shoot first and ask questions later."
// DisplayNames :
"P3579832543" "Wastelander"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Wastelander_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Renegade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P830862222" "Whether soldiers of fortune, former Destroyers, or ex-military, the Renegades are deadly combatants who are skilled with a large number of weapons they've acquired over the years.  Their superior combat ability often lands them in leadership positions amongst groups of survivors in the wilderness."
// DisplayNames :
"P456035166" "Renegade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Renegade_Female 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Dregs_Chain_Gun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P193312026" "Chain Gun"

