// Villain Def - Event_Jack_in_Irons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4148812076" "Believe it or not, this burly giant is proud of his appearance. He adorns himself with the severed heads of his victims, and he takes great pleasure in the panic these accessories evoke. Jack wandered the spirit plane for centuries until the Red Caps found him and brought him to Croatoa. All in all, he's pleased with his new digs. There are plenty of people to frighten, and that suits him fine."
// GroupDescription :
"P3750503788" "Red Caps"
// DisplayNames :
"P2939956726" "Jack in Irons"

