// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1987464941" "Horrible fiends gather at this banner with the intent to commit blind acts of violence and cruelty.  As long as this banner stands these Dark Fiends will continue to conjure forth these manifestations of the ugliness within humanity."
// DisplayClassName :
"P1824434283" "Mystic Banner"
// DisplayNames :
"P3321738460" "Banner of Fiends"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_DAWomenScornedSigil 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2006110681" "Manifestations of baleful scorned women gather at this banner.  The Banner of Scorn channels the vengeful side of human nature to conjure these entities, and will continue to do so as long as the Banner still stands."
// DisplayNames :
"P2221792238" "Banner of Scorn"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_DATransparentTerrorsSigil 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2173791339" "The Banner of Terror feeds off of humanity's fears and causes it to manifest into the Transparent Terrors that guard this banner.  These horrific phantasmal entities seek to shatter the fragile psyches of humanity with terrible fear."
// DisplayNames :
"P34743842" "Banner of Terror"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_DAMonsterMayhemSigil 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3016194496" "This banner feeds upon humanity's need for destruction conjuring up manifestations representative of this urge.  The horrible creatures that guard this banner represent an unimaginable threat to the material world."
// DisplayNames :
"P1646040937" "Banner of Mayhem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Warworks_War_Walker_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2569777715" "War Walkers are meant to serve one purpose, to instill terror into its foes as it obliterates them with its deadly particle cannons. The mechanical behemoths represent the pinnacle of Praetorian technology."
// GroupDescription :
"P1833469820" "Praetorians"
// DisplayNames :
"P4105718507" "War Walker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Olympian_Guard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1892167528" "These soldiers are said to be the recipients of the most advanced genetic and bio-engineering Praetoria has to offer. Only Tyrant and his Praetors are more powerful than the mighty Olympian Guard."
// DisplayNames :
"P509661734" "Olympian Guard"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Mobile_Artillery 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P833407285" "IDF Mobile Artillery is an enhanced soldier with the most advance heavy artillery equipment available. Combining short, medium, and long range arms, the Mobile Artillery is a almost a WarWorks Goliath's worth of hurt in a much more dexterous and mobile package."
// DisplayNames :
"P1037359178" "Mobile Artillery"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Warworks_ACU 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P1313638232" "ACU"

