// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3658774639" "Mk-VI "Victoria" androids are a deadly assassin android model. Unlike the ACU, BCU and Warwalkers these cunning automatons prefer to employ stealth to engage in melee and deliver killing blows to their enemies."
// DisplayNames :
"P882889850" "Mk-VI "Victoria""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Warworks_Mobile_Defense_Turret 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P662588807" "Armed with plasma weaponry capable of piercing through the toughest of armor, these turrets are an incredibly effective deterrent for keeping trespassers out of the Lambda sector and other vital Praetorian military outposts."
// DisplayNames :
"P3764452896" "Mobile Defense Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_GuardianTurret_Mobile 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P565091424" "Guardian Turrets are mobile turrets that ensure the security of sensitive areas."
// DisplayNames :
"P1397223048" "Mobile Guardian Turret"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Seer_Augur 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P1586206284" "Augur"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Commander 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P377725382" "Tyrant's Imperial Defense Force troopers are the most advanced soldiers in his arsenal. IDF Commanders lead the IDF Forces to war offering a frightening array of plasma weaponry. They have little need of bulky powered armor, their innate superior genetic structure proving to be more than a match for conventional weapons."
// DisplayNames :
"P3223493145" "Commander"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Heavy_Commander 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P955342276" "IDF Heavy Commanders can lead the Heavy Troopers into combat or occasionally supply heavy support on their own to a unit. They overcome the short range flaws of the Heavy Trooper with the addition of plasma machine guns to handle close range foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P785683335" "Heavy Commander"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Neuron_Android_Mender 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2583662328" "Menders are often seen repairing broken structures and machines, including other Androids. Their top priority is to keep the other Androids in tip-top working condition."
// DisplayNames :
"P3360484283" "Repair Companion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Neuron_Android_Builder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2615994109" "Should another Clockwork Android fall due to unforeseen circumstances or job hazards the Builders are there to rebuild the fallen Android on the job."
// DisplayNames :
"P263848433" "Construction Companion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Neuron_Android_Dismantler 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P214233924" "Dismantlers are occasionally called in when their plasma torches can be put to use to tear apart crumbling or collapsed buildings. These behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the Android labor units."
// DisplayNames :
"P942125564" "Demolition Companion"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Neuron_Android_Lifter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P857786330" "Lifters, as their name indicates, do a lot of the heavy lifting and construction. They are able to easily lift machinery and building materials that previously could only be lifted by powerful cranes. These behemoth Androids are the heavy lifters, movers and builders of the Android labor units."
// DisplayNames :
"P3851276889" "Carryall Companion"

