"P810752571" "Hauler Bot"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Warworks_Goliath_War_Walker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1154066920" "The dreadnaughts tend to lead invasion forces due to their incredible resilience and destructive prowess. Wherever the Goliath War Walker goes, a trail of destruction is left in its wake."
// DisplayNames :
"P4154397344" "Goliath War Walker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_AntiMatter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3568190518" "Trapped within his powered armor, Anti-Matter used to be Tyrants primary scientific consultant. He and Neuron were once the best of friends and created the Clockwork of Praetorian Earth together. Of late his theories have been more and more radical causing Tyrant to lean on Neuron for research and analysis. Unbeknownst to anyone Anti-Matter had cracked the Portal tech. He is waiting to reveal his breakthrough in order to garner favor from Tyrant and his true love, Dominatrix."
// DisplayNames :
"P2638195017" "Anti-Matter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_MotherMayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2379560507" "Shalice Tilman, also known as Mother, is the Praetor of Health in Praetoria. She is the pioneer behind the revolutionary Seer Project, which ensures the safety and well being of all Praetorians by monitoring the people's thoughts through a network of psychics. Tilman herself is regarded as the most powerful psychic in the world after having joined her consciousness with that of Aurora Borealis. Both women now inhabit Aurora's body and have combined their powers to do far more for Praetoria together than they ever could apart."
// DisplayNames :
"P754644444" "Mother Mayhem"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2243799435" "Praetor White, as he is known on Praetoria, heads up the Powers Division for Emperor Cole. These super-powered individuals act as the ultimate police force in keeping Praetoria the utopia it appears to be. All the while Praetor White feeds on the instability of the government and makes his own opportunities to look good."
// DisplayNames :
"P472388814" "Marauder"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Bobcat 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3485716829" "Created during the tail end of the Hamidon Wars, genetic hybrids were made by a variety of military and privately owned laboratories in an attempt to create super powered soldiers to fight the Devouring Earth. Bobcat is one such experiment that merged human and feline DNA. Left abandoned and forgotten after the war she eventually escaped from the lab and roamed the streets of Praetoria City until Neuron found her.<br><br>Initially feral and incredibly bad tempered, she quickly grew accustomed to civilized life. She has taken up a near permanent residence in Studio 55, using her influence as a Praetor's girlfriend to remodel the club as she sees fit."
// DisplayNames :
"P2478243469" "Bobcat"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_BattleMaiden 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1731038261" "Battle Maiden receives her powers from her halberd, a nanite-infested weapon from Warrior Earth. She has amassed a small army of warriors from that dimension as her personal guard."
// DisplayNames :
"P224831530" "Battle Maiden"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_BlackSwan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1355655770" "Black Swan was born with a connection to the Netherworld. Somehow she was able to manufacture an entire dimension, giving her a huge source of power, a place called Shadow Earth."
// DisplayNames :
"P2927505880" "Black Swan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Chimera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1722042947" "Known in Praetoria as Praetor Sinclair, he is Emperor Cole's ultimate assassin. When his parents were killed by Doppelganger, Justin Sinclair was given the opportunity of a lifetime. Doppelganger took the boy under his wing and trained him to be the world's premier silent killer."
// DisplayNames :
"P3089161593" "Chimera"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Dominatrix 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1486236338" "Being the powered grand-daughter of Emperor Cole has its perks. Praetor Duncan trains new Powers Division recruits while at the same time stringing Anti-Matter along, as if he ever had a chance to be with a woman of her stature."
// DisplayNames :
"P2422410067" "Dominatrix"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Diabolique 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P11273139" "Tammy Arcanus was born with great Magical powers on Praetorian Earth, just like she was on Primal Earth. Unfortunately they manifested very differently. As she reached adolescence she began exploring her powers before she was trained. She used astral projection to cast her spirit forth. So intoxicated was she by the new wonders that she was discovering she returned to her body too late to link with it. She watched helplessly as it withered and died without a spirit. As a living ghost, she found herself bound by Emperor Cole himself, forced to do his bidding for the foreseeable future."
// DisplayNames :
"P3914604464" "Diabolique"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Siege 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3281617799" "The masterpiece of Neuron, Siege is the most advanced android ever created on Praetorian Earth. Neuron used Tyrant's DNA patterns to create him, making him virtually indestructible and extremely loyal."
// DisplayNames :
"P4059063610" "Siege"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Neuron 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1306877881" "Known as Praetor Berry, Praetor of Sciences, in Praetoria, Neuron is a genius who steals his best ideas from Anti-Matter, the Praetorian version of Positron. He and Praetor Duncan dupe Anti-Matter regularly to ensure that Neuron ends up with all the credit and none of the mistakes."
// DisplayNames :
"P3707696793" "Neuron"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_PraetorianInvasion_Nightstar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P510360342" "This android is the creation of Anti-Matter as a testament to his love for Dominatrix. Nightstar is patterned after her in the same way that Siege is patterned after Tyrant. Neuron considers it an inferior design but Anti-Matter knows that one day victory will be his."
// DisplayNames :
"P1442804768" "Nightstar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_Trial_Abomination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2266640747" "This mass of flesh and machine is Dr. Kane's greatest creation."
// GroupDescription :
"P587178069" "Dr. Kane's Horrors"
// DisplayNames :
"P235507155" "The Abomination"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_Trial_Minion_Zombie_Firebomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P217328577" "Stuffed with volatile compounds, this mass of flesh has been built to explode when excited."
// DisplayNames :
"P2224050231" "Angry Zombie Firebomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_Trial_Lieutenant_Zombie_Firebomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1666059723" "Furious Zombie Firebomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
