// DisplayNames :
"P3680487215" "Lurker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_Trial_Demon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2256772953" "A hellish visiage of violence and pain. It came to ruin someone's day."
// DisplayNames :
"P1875471841" "Demon"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_Experiment_Number_Nine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2800926972" "One of Dr. Kane's most foul experiments, this beast is a mass of vile flesh taken from many sources."
// DisplayNames :
"P184550612" "Experiment Number Nine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Halloween_11_NPC_Employees_Zombies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P849911969" "Even the best costumes can't take the boredom out of lumbering around and pretending to be a scary zombie all day."
// DisplayClassName :
"P3492492454" "NPC"
// DisplayNames :
"P1072291783" "Costumed Employee"

