"P2444770917" "Slavering Reanimated Corpse"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Dr_Kane 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2963648363" "Dr. Kane began his career as a dermatologist working for the hazardous waste division of Monoclasty Chemical Company when a fluke accident rendered the doctor mad. Retreating to his mansion, the doctor began working with subjects exhumed from the graveyard behind his home. The results have thus far been chilling."
// DisplayClassName :
"P1828564278" "Mad Scientist"
// GroupDescription :
"P3981186962" "Master of Horror"
// DisplayNames :
"P2361603307" "Dr. Kane"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1009570393" "Nemesis has had over 100 years to perfect his armor and his combat skills. He is a formidable, and wily, opponent."
// GroupDescription :
"P2545933599" "Nemesis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Fake_Nemesis_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1131599923" "No one alive has ever seen Nemesis' true face. He hides within his finely wrought armor, safe behind personal force fields and a variety of armaments. He has many such suits of armor, each of which is a robot in its own right, capable of acting - and killing - independently."
// DisplayNames :
"P3925569688" "Nemesis?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Warhulk_EB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4116619885" "The War Hulk is the largest and most powerful killing machine built by the Prussian Prince of Automatons. It's a veritable walking tank, armed with flamethrowers, storm cannons, and an impressively brutal power claw."
// DisplayNames :
"P2216988219" "Warhulk"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Warhulk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Fake_Nemesis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P4186425052" "Fake Nemesis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3529286796" "Nemesis' officers are some of the best trained soldiers in the world, and they show amazing discipline and devotion to their master. They're armed with the Nemesis lance, a long rifle that can also operate effectively as a spear. Their skill with this weapon makes them deadly at any distance."
// DisplayNames :
"P812459191" "Colonel"
// DisplayNames :
"P1636337351" "Captain"
// DisplayNames :
"P1309445173" "Lieutenant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Elite 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3050944664" "The elite troops of Nemesis' army have tremendous discipline and skill that allows them to stand fast in the face of danger. They carry a deadly weapon that melds a scorching flamethrower with a powerful Gatling gun, giving them all the firepower they need for any foe."
// DisplayNames :
"P1652884659" "Dragoon"
// DisplayNames :
"P1047524647" "Cuirasseur"
// DisplayNames :
"P2385237392" "Hussar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Jaeger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3956205745" "Jaegers take their name from the German word for 'hunter'. They're some of the strangest and most advanced combat robots to ever stalk the streets of Paragon City. Nemesis seems to have a limitless supply of these steam-powered killers, each armed with powerful ranged or melee weaponry."
// DisplayNames :
"P1555202866" "Jaeger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Jaeger_Slicer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P3031428209" "Gewehr Jaeger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Event_Nemesis_Jaeger_Bomber 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P1804057277" "Werfer Jaeger"

