// Villain Def - FirBolg_King_Eochai 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3938451114" "Long ago, King Eochai ruled the Fir Bolg. Today, these monstrous pumpkin-headed giants roam Croatoa. In part, they are the remnants of Eochai's own spirit; in part, they are summoned by the united fury of his tormented people."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - FirBolg_Jack_O_Lantern 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1637233033" "In times of old, the Fir Bolg battled the invading Tuatha de Dannan for control of Ireland, Here in Croatoa, history seems to be repeating itself. The two tribes, transported across an ocean and transformed into monstrous shapes, are waging an eternal war."
// DisplayNames :
"P2146571422" "Soldier"

