// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1010708269" "Eochai's fiery Pumpkin Bomb left this burning patch on the ground."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - FirBolg_Jack_O_Lantern_Lt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - FirBolg_Jack_O_Lantern_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1851285790" "The Fir Bolg honor the legend of Streng, the hero who once championed their people. Many Fir Bolg have now earned the right to bear the ancient hero's name -- usually through acts of great violence against the Tuatha de Dannan."
// DisplayNames :

