// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Infected_Brawl_Contaminated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2241592527" "It doesn't take long for the cesspool water to have an effect. These petty thugs have been drinking from it for only a few days, but already the change in their appearance is apparent."
// DisplayNames :
"P1439024246" "Stricken Brawler"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Infected_Pipe_Contaminated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P37626072" "Stricken Scavenger"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Infected_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1686645759" "Blighted have been subsisting on cesspool water for many weeks now, and the changes they have undergone are far greater than skin deep. They no longer desire any nourishment other than that they take from the cesspool. Their old friends and dreams are entirely forgotten as they slip deeper into their irradiated daze."
// DisplayNames :
"P3109743716" "Blighted"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - Infected_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1942883263" "Most people on Mercy agree: the Devolved no longer qualify as human. After months of consuming nothing but cesspool water, they have become tireless, witless, and wickedly strong. It would be fair to call them more zombie than man."
// DisplayNames :
"P2763724934" "Devolved"

