// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3096011186" "The Knives of Artemis are one of the deadliest groups of mercenary combatants in the world. It is rumored that they number no more than 100, but no one is certain. Masters of stealth and reconnaissance, they are highly skilled with all weapons, but the crossbow is their signature."
// GroupDescription :
"P3077970489" "Knives of Artemis"
// DisplayNames :
"P1403447585" "Mercenary"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2652178786" "The intensive training that the Knives of Artemis go through does not completely explain their deadliness. Promotion in their ranks is through rites of combat known only to their inner circles. It is said, however, that if you challenge you either move up...or you perish."
// DisplayNames :
"P3300442164" "Blade of Artemis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2837297822" "The highest ranks in the Knives of Artemis are small in number. In addition to being deadly combatants, they must be able to adhere to and foster a strict code of honor. Some consider honor among mercenaries hypocrisy of the highest order, they just don't say so in front of any Knives."
// DisplayNames :
"P4115475115" "Hand of Artemis"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Nictus_Hunter_Minion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P471043005" "Mercenary Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Nictus_Hunter_Lieutenant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P681005142" "Blade of Artemis Quantum"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfArtemis_Nictus_Hunter_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P2700678862" "Hand of Artemis Quantum"

