// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_TitanWeapon_MN_Vanquisher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3315214982" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in raw strength and power due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance. Clad in the latest high-tech body suit and still using standard Knives battle gear, she has abandoned her broadsword in favor of a titanic sword with which to devastate her foes."
// DisplayNames :
"P3320115678" "Vanquisher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_DualPistols_MN_Vindicator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P291141359" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her agility and sight due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance. Clad in the latest high-tech body suit and still using standard Knives battle gear, she has abandoned her wrist mounted crossbow in favor of more graceful and deadly dual pistols, chambered with ammunition containing toxins created by the Talons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_StreetJustice_MN_Aspirant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2322986869" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her strength and toughness due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance. Clad in the latest high-tech body suit and still using standard Knives battle gear, she has abandoned her broadsword in favor of the more confrontational and visceral attacks of a brawler."
// DisplayNames :
"P3869308253" "Aspirant"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_DualBlades_MN_Dervish 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2535908709" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her agility and strength due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance. Clad in the latest high-tech body suit and still using standard Knives battle gear, she has abandoned her broadsword in favor of the more graceful and visceral attacks of dual blades."
// DisplayNames :
"P3089788898" "Dervish"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_TitanWeapon_LT_Executioner 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P512278538" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in raw strength and power due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance and has abandoned her broadsword in favor of a titanic sword with which to devastate her foes. The signs of her conversion into a member of the Talons are beginning to show. Though she has removed some of her body suit as her skin begins to provide more natural protection and replaced other pieces with true Talons armor, she still uses most of the standard Knives battle gear."
// DisplayNames :
"P1557825908" "Executioner"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_DualPistols_LT_Enforcer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3875652963" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her agility and sight due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance and has abandoned her wrist mounted crossbow in favor of more graceful and deadly dual pistols, chambered with ammunition containing toxins created by the Talons. The signs of her conversion into a member of the Talons are beginning to show. Though she has removed some of her body suit as her skin begins to provide more natural protection and replaced other pieces with true Talons armor, she still uses most of the standard Knives battle gear."
// DisplayNames :
"P926923295" "Enforcer"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_StreetJustice_LT_Seeker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P15683370" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her strength and toughness due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance and has abandoned her broadsword in favor of the more confrontational and visceral attacks of a brawler. The signs of her conversion into a member of the Talons are beginning to show. Though she has removed some of her body suit as her skin begins to provide more natural protection and replaced other pieces with true Talons armor, she still uses most of the standard Knives battle gear."
// DisplayNames :
"P2230423493" "Seeker"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_DualBlades_LT_Bladestorm 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1712846501" "This mercenary sister has experienced a profound boost in her agility and strength due to her allegiance to the Talons of Vengeance and has abandoned her broadsword in favor of the more graceful and visceral attacks of dual blades. The signs of her conversion into a member of the Talons are beginning to show. Though she has removed some of her body suit as her skin begins to provide more natural protection and replaced other pieces with true Talons armor, she still uses most of the standard Knives battle gear."
// DisplayNames :
"P3485318201" "Bladestorm"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_TitanWeapon_BS_Conqueror 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2032807322" "This mercenary sister has been completely converted into a member of the Talons. Her skin is now replaced with the more protective scales of her brethren and large wings have sprouted from her back. The only remnants present from her previous life are her utility belts and her combat headset. She wields a titanic sword in place of her broadsword."
// DisplayNames :
"P637256559" "Conqueror"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - KnivesOfVengeanceEndgame_DualPistols_BS_Assassin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P275318515" "This mercenary sister has been completely converted into a member of the Talons. Her skin is now replaced with the more protective scales of her brethren and large wings have sprouted from her back. The only remnants present from her previous life are her utility belts and her combat headset. She wields dual pistols using toxic ammunition in place of her wrist mounted crossbow."
// DisplayNames :
"P1165603828" "Assassin"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
