"P2086596503" "This mercenary sister has been completely converted into a member of the Talons. Her skin is now replaced with the more protective scales of her brethren and large wings have sprouted from her back. The only remnants present from her previous life are her utility belts and her combat headset. She has discarded her broadsword in favor of the more visceral combat style of a brawler."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
