// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Minion_Type_22 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2763390168" "These genetically altered humans are given the cold numeric moniker Type 22, suggesting that they were part of an earlier batch of experiments. Genetic meddling has given them immense strength and speed, at the cost of extremely rapid cellular decay."
// DisplayNames :
"P2384194108" "Type 22"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Lieutenant_Type_53 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1516912688" "More advanced genetic creations than their Type 22 counterparts, the Type 53 was created as a command and control unit, as well as a test bed for advanced genetic manipulation. The Type 53 has a targeting computer surgically installed in its head, enabling it to designate a target to its comrades. Genetic meddling has given them immense strength and speed, but once again at the cost of extremely rapid cellular decay."
// DisplayNames :
"P3059567725" "Type 53"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Boss_Type_90 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1515369617" "Advanced genetic abominations; the Type 90 appears to be intended as a mass produced replacement for Power's Division members. They are stronger, faster, and tougher than their compatriots, leading them from the front and inspiring them to fight harder and longer than humanly possible. Genetic meddling has given them immense strength and speed, but once again at the cost of extremely rapid cellular decay."
// DisplayNames :
"P2212582107" "Type 90"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Noble_Savage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2132019042" "The form of a savage monster hides the heart of a noble hero. Betrayed by those he trusted, the Noble Savage has risen above thoughts of vengeance and still seeks to serve the people he swore to protect. Even if they believe he is who they need protection from."
// DisplayNames :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Doctor_Hetzfeld 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P1929121652" "Dr. Hetzfeld is a brilliant, albeit mad scientist. Such is his disdain of Neuron's position as Praetor of the Sciences the Hetzfeld has taken to modifying his own mind and body to put him on a more even footing when it comes to physical capability. He still believes himself to be the superior scientist, and will stop at nothing to prove that to the world."
// GroupDescription :
// DisplayNames :
"P4000988495" "Dr. Hetzfeld"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Minion_Type_22_Improved 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P22601045" "Improved Type 22"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Lieutenant_Type_53_Improved 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P958298884" "Improved Type 53"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Boss_Type_90_Improved 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayNames :
"P211969458" "Improved Type 90"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Lucan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P136898894" "A pillar of advanced genetic manipulation, Lucan v0.65 is actually quite lucid compared to other experiments. Able to communicate with other failed experiments though unknown methods, he is apparently capable of gathering together the furious ghouls and putting their fury to work: toppling the society that created them."
// DisplayNames :
"P1778026656" "Lucan v0.65"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Minion_Type_22_Kamikaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P811941727" "Angry Bombs are unstable cybernetically enhanced humans fitted with high yield explosives. They are commanded into close combat with the enemy where their explosive payload is then detonated."
// DisplayNames :
"P1260342342" "Angry Bomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Lieutenant_Type_53_Kamikaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P4067683268" "Furious Bombs are cybernetically enhanced humans fitted with high yield explosives. They are commanded into close combat with the enemy where their explosive payload is then detonated."
// DisplayNames :
"P3541523537" "Furious Bomb"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsClean_Boss_Type_90_Kamikaze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P2000571841" "Berserker Bombs are massive cybernetically enhanced humans fitted with high yield explosives. They are commanded into close combat with the enemy where their explosive payload is then detonated."
// DisplayNames :
"P4140267900" "Berserker Bomb"

