// Villain Def - GhoulsContaminated_Minion_Hunter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P3567042964" "Genetically altered to have a hyper developed medulla oblongata, Ghouls produce adrenaline at a prodigious rate, enhancing their strength, speed, and aggressiveness. Packs of hunters prowl the tunnels beneath Praetoria, eating anything and everything they can get their hands on, sometimes even each other."
// DisplayNames :
"P2335868629" "Contaminated Hunter"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsContaminated_Lieutenant_Painted_One 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayDescription :
"P416465367" "Genetically altered to have a hyper developed medulla oblongata, Ghouls produce adrenaline at a prodigious rate, enhancing their strength, speed, and aggressiveness. Painted ones lead packs of hunters, directing their rage by showering their victims in disgusting bile which attracts nearby Ghouls."
// DisplayNames :
"P2742962634" "Contaminated Painted One"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Villain Def - GhoulsContaminated_Boss_Manslayer 
